/*
 * Declares the VariableVerification module, which provides helper predicates
 * and validation routines for variable-reference values.
 *
 * These checks are used throughout semantic validation to classify and validate
 * variable usages(self, parameters, iterators, references, lazy variables) and
 * to enforce rules such as shadowing prevention and native-type name
 * restrictions.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::verif::variable
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/verif/variable.yr
 * @Author(s):
